ACPA/MSMDA — heuristic recommendation engine (development release)

Copyright (c) 2026 Youness Moudettir.

The released code implements a deterministic, illustrative 18-criterion
contextual weighting and relative-ranking pipeline. It uses synthetic data
and is not an empirically validated recommendation system.

The published source code is a defined subset of the wider ACPA/MSMDA
development project. Separate private components, original research data,
student records and local state are not included.

